{"id":"66e51676c0948f71","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-frames.md","title":"Quine Frames and Maximal Frames","display":"df-smullyan-frames — Quine Frames and Maximal Frames","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-frames","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-frames"],"display":"df-smullyan-frames — Quine Frames and Maximal Frames","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 45–46（PDF 62–63）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-frames"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-frames</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-frames — Quine Frames and Maximal Frames"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 45–46（PDF 62–63）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f990aa46292ead55\" href=\"?note=f990aa46292ead55\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-base-parts\">92-df-smullyan-base-parts</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>底数固定为 13；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*_ {13}\">\\(*_ {13}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Part}_{13}\">\\(\\operatorname{Part}_{13}\\)</span> 采用上游定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ones}_{13},\\operatorname{Frame}_{13},\\operatorname{MF}_{13}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ones}_{13},\\operatorname{Frame}_{13},\\operatorname{MF}_{13}\\)</span> 分别表示全 1 位串、框架和某个数中的最长框架。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}frames}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ones}_{13}(t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow t&gt;0\\land\n\\forall u\\leq t\\;(\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(u,t)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(1,u)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Frame}_{13}(f)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists t\\leq f\\;(\\operatorname{Ones}_{13}(t)\\land f=(2*_{13}t)*_{13}2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MF}_{13}(f,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Frame}_{13}(f)\\land\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(f,z)\\land\n\\forall h\\leq z\\;[(\\operatorname{Frame}_{13}(h)\\land\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(h,z))\\Rightarrow h\\leq f].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}frames}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ones}_{13}(t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow t&gt;0\\land\n\\forall u\\leq t\\;(\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(u,t)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(1,u)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Frame}_{13}(f)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists t\\leq f\\;(\\operatorname{Ones}_{13}(t)\\land f=(2*_{13}t)*_{13}2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MF}_{13}(f,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Frame}_{13}(f)\\land\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(f,z)\\land\n\\forall h\\leq z\\;[(\\operatorname{Frame}_{13}(h)\\land\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(h,z))\\Rightarrow h\\leq f].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>全 1 数的每个非空片段含数字 1；反之考察每个一位片段可排除其它数字。框架的位串是 2 后接若干个 1 再接 2。对于框架，数值大小与位串长度大小一致，所以 MF 的数值比较确实表达“至少与其它框架一样长”。</p>\n<p>拼接的图关系需展开为上一节点的有界 Cat，不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*_ {13}\">\\(*_ {13}\\)</span> 当作对象语言的额外函数符号。这里所有关系为原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span> 关系。构造编码时可以选择 1 的数量大于所有载荷位长，从而同时排除载荷内部和跨边界出现的更长框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-base-parts","status":"resolved","id":"f990aa46292ead55","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"*_ {13}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Part}_{13}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ones}_{13},\\operatorname{Frame}_{13},\\operatorname{MF}_{13}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}frames}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ones}_{13}(t)&\\leftrightarrow t>0\\land\n\\forall u\\leq t\\;(\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(u,t)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(1,u)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Frame}_{13}(f)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists t\\leq f\\;(\\operatorname{Ones}_{13}(t)\\land f=(2*_{13}t)*_{13}2),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MF}_{13}(f,z)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Frame}_{13}(f)\\land\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(f,z)\\land\n\\forall h\\leq z\\;[(\\operatorname{Frame}_{13}(h)\\land\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(h,z))\\Rightarrow h\\leq f].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"*_ {13}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false}],"bytes":1834,"backlinks":[{"id":"9e6768aadf6214a6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{MF}_{13}$ 与位串片段关系见 [[92-df-smullyan-frames]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"无指数算术化：[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]] → [[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]] → [[92-df-smullyan-frames]] → [[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-frames]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-frames]]"}],"outgoing":["f990aa46292ead55"]}